This package merges catalogs from these packages, which it depends on and
does not copy:

- @url-sanitize/clearurls: ClearURLs-derived data, LGPL-3.0-only
- @url-sanitize/brave: Brave Debouncer, query-filter and clean-URLs data, MPL-2.0
- @url-sanitize/firefox: Firefox Query Stripping data, MPL-2.0

@url-sanitize/adguard (AdGuard URL Tracking data, GPL-3.0-only) is not a
default source and not a dependency; add it yourself to opt in.

The merge code is MIT. Each catalog's data keeps its source license.
